# Week 3 — Agentic Workflow

### Status: ⚪ Planned

The third phase converts the basic LLM → SQL pipeline into a stateful agentic workflow.


User Question
      ↓
Intent Analyzer
      ↓
Analysis Planner
      ↓
Tool Selection
      ↓
SQL / Python Execution
      ↓
Result Validation
      ↓
Self-Correction
      ↓
Final Result


### Planned Features

- [ ] LangGraph integration
- [ ] Agent state
- [ ] Intent analysis
- [ ] Analysis planning
- [ ] Tool selection
- [ ] SQL error analysis
- [ ] Query regeneration
- [ ] Self-correction
- [ ] Retry mechanism
- [ ] Conversation context

### Self-Correction Workflow


Generated SQL
     ↓
Execute Query
     ↓
Error?
  ↙     ↘
Yes      No
 ↓        ↓
Analyze  Result
Error
 ↓
Correct SQL
 ↓
Retry


The system will use a limited retry mechanism rather than repeatedly regenerating queries.

