Intent Analysis
      ↓
Analysis Planning
      ↓
SQL Generation
      ↓
SQL Validation
      ↓
DuckDB Execution
      ↓
Result Validation
      ↓
Visualization
      ↓
Insight Generation


The final response could be:


Electronics generated the highest revenue
in 2025 with total revenue of ₹18.43 lakh.

The response will also contain the relevant visualization and, where appropriate, the generated SQL.

